!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Libraries were created according to the Drop-seq protocol in Macosko et al. Cell 2015. Following reverse transcription, exonuclease I treatment, and PCR, cDNA libraries were quantified and 600 pg of cDNA was tagmented using Nextera XT library prep kit.
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were processed using the DropSeq analysis pipeline developed by the McCarroll lab (http://mccarrolllab.com/dropseq/)
!Sample_data_processing = Individual cells were tagged with barcodes, and transcripts within each cell were tagged with distinct UMIs (Unique Molecular Identifiers).
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were trimmed at 3' end to remove poly(A) tails with length greater than 5 and at the 5' end for adapters
!Sample_data_processing = Reads with barcode base quality less than 10 were filtered out..
!Sample_data_processing = Raw reads were aligned to mouse  (GRCm38) genome by STAR (v2.4.0) with default settings
!Sample_data_processing = UMI counts expression matrix were generated using Dropseq Tools software (v1.13.1)
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCm38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Tab-delimited text file consisting of UMI gene counts for cells with minimum 100 genes.
!Sample_platform_id = GPL24247
